   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ETHIOPIA COUNTRY PROGRAMME: CLIMATE RESILIENT FOREST LIVELIHOODS in ETHIOPIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program is designed to ensure resilience of forest dependent communities to climate shock
